msgid "See Also"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CodingStandards.md:1836
msgid ""
"A lot of these comments and recommendations have been culled from other "
"sources. Two particularly important books for our work are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CodingStandards.md:1839
msgid ""
"[Effective C++] by Scott Meyers.  Also interesting and useful are \"More "
"Effective C++\" and \"Effective STL\" by the same author."
msgstr ""

